RUF061 [*] Use context-manager form of `pytest.deprecated_call()`
  --> RUF061_deprecated_call.py:21:5
   |
20 | def test_error_trivial():
21 |     pytest.deprecated_call(raise_deprecation_warning, "deprecated")
   |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
help: Use `pytest.deprecated_call()` as a context-manager
   |
20 | def test_error_trivial():
   -     pytest.deprecated_call(raise_deprecation_warning, "deprecated")
21 +     with pytest.deprecated_call():
22 +         raise_deprecation_warning("deprecated")
23 |
   |
note: This is an unsafe fix and may change runtime behavior

